## Project Structure

The main project structure is shown below:

```text
FoodMart/
│
├── cart/
│   ├── views.py
│   ├── urls.py
│   └── context_processors.py
│
├── products/
│   ├── models.py
│   ├── views.py
│   └── urls.py
│
├── templates/
│   ├── products/
│   │   └── home.html
│   │
│   └── cart/
│       └── cart_detail.html
│
├── static/
│   └── foodmart/
│       ├── css/
│       ├── js/
│       └── images/
│
├── manage.py
├── db.sqlite3
└── README.md
```

This structure represents the main parts of the project and may change as development continues.

